{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And a man found him, and behold, he was wandering in the field.</b> Here Gabriel hinted to him the three exiles: ת = 400 of the exile of Egypt. ע = 70 of the exile of Babylon. ה = of the exile of Edom, at the end of 5,000 — may it be speedily concluded in our days, Amen. From the mouth of my master my father, of blessed memory. And a similar thing I heard from R. Benjamin, may his memory be for a blessing, interpreting ״ואחר עד עתה״ written regarding Jacob, that is, the delay of the three exiles that I explained."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:32.248422329Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}